Z||000000||AusFiero||08-28-2001||09:06 AM||||I got an email requesting I do a custom job on a Fiero further down the track for someone. Not just the image, but build it. The request was for a wide body not unlike a Ferarri. This car would need 10" and 12" wheels to fill the wheel wells. I think it would be criminal to have anything less than a twin turbo V6 or a V8. <BR>Think he will like it? <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierocustom001.jpg"> <P>I used a picture I found on the Forum as a bas for it. Who's car was this? <BR><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||6
