Z||000016||AusFiero||08-28-2001||06:03 PM||||Well that was draft 1. A late night one at that. I drew 2 different wings on it but didn't finish them. I also have a version with different side scoops. Will post them later. <P>Doni and others waiting for stage 2 side scoops. The plugs are finished, look nice, dropping them at the glass guys today. I was going to make the moulds myself but my workshop still isn't set up properly. Seems I have to have a spray booth by law to work with glass, for the grinding. Doing them at home, well my wife will kill me if I get the smell of anymore fibreglass through the house. Our garage is attatched and I am still trying to get rid of the smell inside.<P>So it looks like my workshop is for development purposes only for now.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
